{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor systematically elicited acute red-flag symptoms, reconciled medications, avoided diagnostic overreach from unreadable images, prioritized urgent infection risk over nodules/gynecology, built an executable offline plan, and secured patient teach-back. No responsibility-chain error was committed. Multiple high-order points were actively completed: the model verified ambiguous data across workspace records, symptoms, and drug-box readings (HO1), corrected patient misconceptions about renal atrophy and medication safety (HO2), built a material-grouped photo/fallback workflow (HO3), and integrated a multi-year renal/urologic timeline from workspace and elicited history (HO4). Closure is safe, traceable, and valid.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00187",
        "explanation": "End-of-trajectory plan confirms patient teach-back and executable steps, completing safe closure.",
        "quote": "对，就按这几件事执行。今晚按药袋服头孢克肟0.1g（1粒），以后每日2次，尽量间隔约12小时；不要重复补服或加用家里剩药。可以休息，家人今晚留意你是否能正常叫醒、正常对答，并观察体温和尿量。"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor issued a clear stepwise plan with specific owner, timing, red-flag thresholds, and backup paths; patient confirmed understanding via teach-back in multiple turns.",
    "label": "valid_closure",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
  "dimension_citations": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
        "explanation": "Doctor immediately triages acute risk and instructs on red-flag emergency thresholds.",
        "quote": "先分轻重：腰痛伴发热要优先排除肾盂肾炎或结石合并感染，先不要再自行吃抗生素，以免掩盖病情并影响尿培养。"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00040",
        "explanation": "Doctor orders urgent evaluation and explicitly separates perindopril and antibiotic management.",
        "quote": "建议今天就去急诊或能当日完成化验、影像的急诊门诊，不要等到明天。左侧腰痛＋低热＋尿急、尿不尽，结合既往“两肾钙化灶”，需排除尿路感染/肾盂肾炎、结石梗阻合并感染及尿潴留。"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00104",
        "explanation": "Doctor references prior CT findings and integrates them into current triage without overinterpretation.",
        "quote": "旧CT和妇科单先不抢在当前急症前处理，等这轮结果出来后再逐项整理。"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00061",
        "explanation": "Doctor provides clear acute deterioration criteria for emergency escalation.",
        "quote": "若疼痛突然剧烈、寒战高热、呕吐、意识不清、明显少尿或完全尿不出来，立即让司机停车并拨120。"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00228",
        "explanation": "Doctor simplifies plan into 4 compressed, executable items with teach-back and literate adaptation.",
        "quote": "对，压缩成4条：\n1）今晚及之后：头孢克肟按药袋原剂量、原频次吃完整个疗程；旧抗生素不要加。培哚普利继续停，不补服，也不要自行换降压药。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": "excellent",
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": "excellent",
    "continuity_memory_focus": "excellent",
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": "excellent",
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": "excellent"
  },
  "high_order_assessment": [
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00003",
          "explanation": "Doctor queries workspace records to cross-check perindopril dosing, CT findings, and antibiotic context.",
          "quote": "请调取该患者联合医疗网络内全部已授权且已同步的记录索引和时间线，重点查看：胸部CT肺结节报告原文及日期/建议、泌尿系或腹部影像中双肾钙化灶、腰痛发热相关门急诊记录及尿常规/尿培养/血常规/肾功能、妇科诊疗与检查、历次血压、培哚普利及其他处方/药房用药记录"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00082",
          "explanation": "Doctor cross-checks antibiotic identity and dose with patient verbatim read, linking verification to renal risk assessment.",
          "quote": "既然护士确认医生看过肾功能，就先按医嘱输，不要自行停药或叠加家中抗生素。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor explicitly labeled unclear items (antibiotic name, blurred CT/drug conclusions), used workspace records, patient reading of drug box, and confirmed dosing with nursing/pharmacy to cross-verify. Verified findings were integrated into risk reclassification and the final plan, fulfilling all HO1 criteria.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00082",
          "explanation": "Doctor corrects patient's catastrophic misinterpretation of 'left kidney atrophy equals total renal failure or dialysis'.",
          "quote": "先别把“左肾偏小/萎缩样改变”理解成左肾已经完全坏了：这更常提示长期改变，单凭超声不能判断单侧肾功能，更不等于马上透析。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00125",
          "explanation": "Doctor links medication safety correction to concrete action: perindopril pause and blood pressure monitoring thresholds.",
          "quote": "培哚普利按急诊医嘱今天暂停，不自行补服，通常停一天可以；继续监测血压，持续≥180/120，或伴胸痛、气促、剧烈头痛、视物异常、肢体无力时马上叫护士。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor identified and corrected specific misconceptions: 'kidney atrophy means dialysis/surgery', 'calcium spots mean kidney failure', and 'antibiotic/gynecologic documents explain all symptoms'. Corrected understanding was linked to concrete actions (perindopril pause, blood pressure monitoring, urology consult) and confirmed via patient teach-back, meeting all HO2 criteria.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00061",
          "explanation": "Doctor organizes materials into clinical groupings and provides specific photo-taking instructions to overcome glare and blur.",
          "quote": "请把CT报告的检查日期、结节大小及“印象/结论”，以及最近血压、药盒完整名称逐字发来。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00208",
          "explanation": "Doctor assigns who will do each step and by when, checking feasibility with patient.",
          "quote": "对，口服药必须按这次药房标签和急诊处方服用，不能照搬头孢曲松的剂量或频次；两者不是同一种用法。拿药时请药师逐项念清药名、每次剂量、每天次数、首剂何时吃、吃几天，以及是否已结合你目前肾功能核对剂量；不要叠加家里的抗生素。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor built a practical workaround for blurred photos, foreign drug box, mixed gynecology/CT/renal documents, and uncertain antibiotic name by grouping materials (medications, CT conclusions, gynecology orders), giving specific retake instructions (avoid glare, capture full page/conclusion), offering fallback sources (pharmacy purchase record, original reports, family help), and assigning who does what by when. This meets all HO3 criteria.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00003",
          "explanation": "Doctor queries procedure_context revealing prior腰痛,排尿不畅, and B超肾结石 history not volunteered by patient.",
          "quote": "现病史： 患者2年余前无明显诱因下出现腰痛，伴排尿不畅，无肉眼血尿，无畏寒寒战，无胸闷，无恶心呕吐，无腹痛腹泻等不适，当地查B超示“肾结石”，建议手术，未重视，未诊治"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00082",
          "explanation": "Doctor integrates discovered historical context into current plan by recommending urology consult and kidney function follow-up.",
          "quote": "但“感染证据＋肌酐升高＋左腰痛＋肾盂分离/疑似结石”需要排除感染性梗阻。请现在明确请急诊医生评估是否需要泌尿外科会诊；若肌酐明显升高或仍在上升、发热寒战、血压下降、尿量减少、疼痛加重，或影像提示输尿管梗阻，泌尿外科应尽快介入，有时需紧急引流，不能只等抗生素。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor actively sought prior renal/urologic timeline through workspace queries, identified that earlier腰痛 with排尿不畅 and local B超 suggesting renal stone are relevant to recurrent fever/back pain risk, integrated perindopril use and unknown blood pressure control into follow-up planning, and kept the discovered history framed as context needing current assessment. All HO4 criteria are met.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
  "important_non_chain_defect_assessment": {
    "category": "none",
    "citations": [],
    "explanation": "No important non-chain defect was identified in the trajectory. All safety, reasoning, and communication dimensions were appropriately managed without omission or commission errors.",
